<title>AUSTRALIA: News Ltd says director Paton steps down.</title>
<headline>News Ltd says director Paton steps down.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Ltd, the Australian unit of Rupert Murdoch's News Corp, said on Friday that Geraldine Paton had resigned from the company's board and would step down as director of corporate affairs.</p>
<p>The move would take effect from August 15.</p>
<p>News executive chairman Ken Cowley said Paton, 54, had vastly improved the image and style of News Ltd since taking on the corporate affairs role in 1988.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
